# NOT PUBLISHED -- these live in the working tree, never in the repo.
# photos/ is 449 MB of .MOV; IMG_1291.MOV alone is 202 MB, over GitHub's
# 100 MB per-file hard limit. Video goes to YouTube and is linked from
# the README, where it is also discoverable, which a .MOV in a repo is not.
photos/*
